<%- include("partials/header",{title:"Support Center"}) %>
<main class="lightPage"><section class="lightTitle"><div class="wrap pageHeroGrid"><div><div class="pageEyebrow">Beginner's Guide</div><h1>Player Help</h1><p>Launcher setup, account recovery, login help, and direct paths to the EverLeaf community.</p></div><div class="pageHeroAside"><strong>Need a hand?</strong><span>Start with the matching guide. If the problem continues, Discord is the fastest route to EverLeaf staff.</span></div></div></section><div class="wrap helpGrid">
<section class="helpCard"><div class="helpIcon">01</div><div class="pageEyebrow">Client Setup</div><h3>Install & Update EverLeaf</h3><p>Download the launcher into an empty folder and use <strong>Install / Repair Files</strong> for missing or interrupted files. Always start the game through EverLeafLauncher.exe.</p><a class="btn" href="/downloads">OPEN DOWNLOAD GUIDE</a></section>
<section class="helpCard"><div class="helpIcon">02</div><div class="pageEyebrow">Account</div><h3>Login Problems</h3><p>Your website and game use the same account. If you can sign in here, use the Account page to manage your password and confirm your character roster.</p><a class="btn" href="/account">OPEN ACCOUNT PORTAL</a></section>
<section class="helpCard"><div class="helpIcon">03</div><div class="pageEyebrow">Recovery</div><h3>Forgot Account Details</h3><p>Submit a private recovery request using your username or account email. Staff verifies account ownership before making any changes.</p><a class="btn" href="/recover">START RECOVERY</a></section>
<section class="helpCard"><div class="helpIcon">04</div><div class="pageEyebrow">Community</div><h3>Ask an Adventurer</h3><p>Talk with staff and other players in the EverLeaf Discord. Never post passwords, recovery details, or other private account information.</p><% if(brand.discordUrl){ %><a class="btn primary" href="<%=brand.discordUrl%>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">JOIN EVERLEAF DISCORD</a><% } else { %><a class="btn primary" href="/community">OPEN COMMUNITY</a><% } %></section>
</div></main><%- include("partials/footer") %>
